From: pbs05 <27010143+pbs05@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 14:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: disconnect PHY after shared QDMA teardown

Disconnect the PHY at the end of airoha_dev_stop(), after the GDM port
forwarding and LRO state have been torn down.

Signed-off-by: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -2264,6 +2264,8 @@ static int airoha_dev_stop(struct net_device *netdev)
 	if (netdev->features & NETIF_F_LRO)
 		airoha_dev_lro_disable(dev);
 
+	phylink_disconnect_phy(dev->phylink);
+
 	return 0;
 }
 
